itchen house tavern]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-b      shape     342 tok  brown wooden chair, blue seat and back cushions  [furniture kitchen house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-b-wood shape     149 tok  plain brown wooden chair, curved open back  [furniture kitchen house tavern]\n== sofa\nkaykit-furniture-bits:couch        shape     295 tok  chunky blue cushioned three-seat sofa  [furniture lounge house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:couch-pillows shape     298 tok  chunky orange cushioned three-seat sofa  [furniture lounge house]\nkenney-furniture:lounge-design-sofa shape     162 tok  pale blue modern sofa, white legs  [furniture lounge house modern]\nkenney-furniture:lounge-design-sofa-corner shape     275 tok  large L-shaped pale blue corner sofa  [furniture lounge house modern]\nkenney-furniture:lounge-sofa       shape     132 tok  pink upholstered three-seat sofa  [furniture lounge house]\nkenney-furniture:lounge-sofa-corner shape     155 tok  L-shaped pink upholstered corner sofa  [furniture lounge house]\n== filing cabinet\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-medium shape     116 tok  low wide brown wooden cabinet on short feet  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-medium-decorated shape     570 tok  low brown wooden cabinet with potted plants on top  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-small shape     170 tok  small brown wooden nightstand, two pale drawers  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-small-decorated shape     489 tok  small brown nightstand topped with an orange lamp and trinkets  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-restaurant-bits:kitchencounter-straight-a shape     202 tok  white kitchen cabinet counter with an orange wooden top  [furniture counter kitchen]\nkenney-furniture:bathroom-cabinet  shape      92 tok  narrow light wood wall cabinet, white mirror door  [furniture bathroom house]\n== bookshelf\nno match for \"bookshelf\"\n== plant\nbush                               shape      65 tok  roun