{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q2gUbVkaAJLCha2Rf72Ngv","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"g\":\"playstation\",\"ix\":false,\"iy\":false,\"keys\":[\"invertY\",\"glyphs\",\"invertX\",\"textSpeed\"]}\nSettings\nDISPLAY\nFull screen\nOFF\nCamera zoom\nCloser or farther than the game frames it. In play: the mouse wheel, - and =, or a pinch\n1×\nFrame rate\nAuto: every refresh while the game keeps up, every other one, evenly, when it can't. 60: every other refresh on a 120 Hz screen. Full: every refresh\n‹ AUTO ›\nShow frame rate\nAt the top of the screen: frames drawn a second, the screen's refresh and a frame's cost\nOFF\nPixel scaling\nSharp: every pixel the same size. Fill: the whole screen\n‹ AUTO ›\nScreen filter\nScanlines: the dark lines between a TV's rows. CRT: those, its colored stripes and its darker corners\n‹ CLEAN ›\nSOUND\nSound\nON\nVolume\n70%\nMusic\n50%\nEffects\n100%\nSound in the background\nKeep playing sound while the page is hidden\nOFF\nAudio offset\nThe music this much earlier, for speakers or headphones that lag (wireless ones: 150 to 250). Calibrate: tap on the clicks you hear\n0 ms\nCALIBRATE\nCOMFORT\nReduce motion\nNo screen shake, shorter flashes, still menus\nOFF\nScreen shake\n100%\nScreen flashes\n100%\nGAME\nInvert stick up / down\nOFF\nController button symbols\n‹ PLAYSTATION ›\nInvert stick left / right\nOFF\nText speed\n‹ NORMAL ›\nCONTROLS\nRESTORE DEFAULTS\nBACK","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bdd4161a-5598-4ff8-9e94-bd9d9c377514","uuid":"6d5f380a-26e0-432d-8a90-3335364923ff","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:49:59.038Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\"g\":\"playstation\",\"ix\":false,\"iy\":false,\"keys\":[\"invertY\",\"glyphs\",\"invertX\",\"textSpeed\"]}\nSettings\nDISPLAY\nFull screen\nOFF\nCamera zoom\nCloser or farther than the game frames it. In play: the mouse wheel, - and =, or a pinch\n1×\nFrame rate\nAuto: every refresh while the game keeps up, every othe